{"speciesId":476,"names":{"fr":"Tarinorme","es":"Probopass","en":"Probopass","ja":"ダイノーズ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It exudes strong magnetism from all over. It controls three small units called Mini-Noses."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It exudes strong magnetism from all over. It controls three small units called Mini-Noses."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It freely controls three small units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It controls three units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force. With them, it can attack the foe from three directions."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It controls three units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force. With them, it can attack the foe from three directions."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il utilise sa force magnétique pour diriger trois petites unités appelées Mini-nez."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It freely controls three small units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il utilise sa force magnétique pour diriger trois petites unités appelées Mini-nez."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It freely controls three small units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It freely controls three units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It freely controls three units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son corps libère une puissante force magnétique. Il dirige trois petites unités appelées Mini-nez."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Emana un fuerte magnetismo. Controla tres pequeñas unidades llamadas mininarices."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It exudes strong magnetism from all over. It controls three small units called Mini-Noses."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"全身から 強い 磁力を 出している。 ３個の チビノーズと 呼ばれる ユニットを 操る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il utilise sa force magnétique pour diriger trois petites unités appelées Mini-nez."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Con el magnetismo que emana, controla tres pequeñas unidades llamadas mininarices."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It freely controls three small units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"チビノーズと 呼ばれる 小さな ３つの ユニットを 磁力で 自由自在に 操っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Son corps libère une puissante force magnétique. Il dirige trois petites unités appelées Mini-nez."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Emana un fuerte magnetismo. Controla tres pequeñas unidades llamadas mininarices."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It exudes strong magnetism from all over. It controls three small units called Mini-Noses."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"全身から 強い 磁力を 出している。 ３個の チビノーズと 呼ばれる ユニットを 操る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il utilise sa force magnétique pour diriger trois petites unités appelées Mini-nez."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Con el magnetismo que emana, controla tres pequeñas unidades llamadas mininarices."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It freely controls three small units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"チビノーズと 呼ばれる 小さな ３つの ユニットを 磁力で 自由自在に 操っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il émet un puissant champ magnétique qui rend tous les appareils électriques des alentours inutilisables."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Crea un campo magnético tan potente que inutiliza cualquier electrodoméstico que se encuentre cerca."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It radiates such a powerful magnetic field that nearby electrical appliances become unusable."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"強い 磁力を 放っているので 近くにある 電化製品は 使いものに ならなくなってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Sans avoir besoin de se déplacer, il pilote ses trois Mini-nez à distance afin de capturer ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Las tres unidades que controla, llamadas mininarices, le permiten atrapar a su presa sin necesidad de mover el resto de su cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"The main body controls three mobile units called Mini-Noses, which it maneuvers to catch prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"本体は 動かず チビノーズと 呼ばれる ３つのユニットを 自在に 操り 獲物を 捕える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il est capable de piloter ses Mini-nez à distance, mais il arrive que l’un d’entre eux s’aventure trop loin et se perde pour ne jamais revenir."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Manipula unas pequeñas unidades conocidas como mininarices, aunque estas a veces se pierden y no saben cómo regresar a Probopass."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Although it can control its units known as Mini-Noses, they sometimes get lost and don’t come back."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"チビノーズと 呼ばれる ユニットを 操るが たまに 迷子に なって 帰ってこないことも あるらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il utilise ses trois petites unités pour combattre ses ennemis et capturer ses proies. Le reste de son corps se contente de donner des ordres."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Usa sus tres pequeñas unidades para capturar presas o combatir, mientras que el resto de su cuerpo se dedica casi solo a impartir órdenes."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It uses three small units to catch prey and battle enemies. The main body mostly just gives orders."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"３つの 小さな ユニットを 使い エサを とったり 敵と 戦う。 本体は ほぼ 命令するだけ。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"It is able to emit powerful magnetism, allowing it control over the iron sand that forms its l